        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-900 mb-2">Key Point</h3>
        <p class="text-amber-800 text-lg">Do not start by building the page. Start by answering: What would make someone say yes today? A strong offer is the foundation of every successful funnel.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Action Steps -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 to-teal-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-emerald-200">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-100 flex items-center justify-center">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-900">Action Steps — Build the Funnel Page</h3>
    </div>
    
    <div class="space-y-4">
      
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">1</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Complete the Sentence</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Write this down: I want people to sign up so they can get ________________.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">2</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Check Against the Checklist</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Does your offer meet all five criteria: easy to understand, useful, connected to sales, simple to deliver, worth an email?</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white rounded-xl p-4 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg flex-shrink-0">3</div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Refine If Needed</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">If your offer is weak on any criteria, adjust it before moving forward.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>',
      title = 'Choose the Offer',
      lesson_number = 2,
      sort_order = 2,
      updated_at = NOW()
    WHERE id = v_lesson_id;
    
    RAISE NOTICE 'Updated lesson: Choose the Offer';
  END IF;

END $$;


-- Insert Quiz Questions for Lesson: Choose the Offer

DO $$
DECLARE
  v_module_id UUID;
  v_lesson_id UUID;
  v_quiz_id UUID;
BEGIN
  -- Get Module by week number
  SELECT id INTO v_module_id FROM public.training_modules WHERE week_number = 8 LIMIT 1;
  
  IF v_module_id IS NULL THEN
    RAISE NOTICE 'Module 8 not found';
    RETURN;
  END IF;

  -- Get the lesson ID
  SELECT id INTO v_lesson_id 
  FROM public.lessons 
  WHERE slug = 'choose-the-offer' AND module_id = v_module_id;
  
  IF v_lesson_id IS NULL THEN
    RAISE NOTICE 'Lesson choose-the-offer not found in module 8';
    RETURN;
  END IF;
  
  -- Delete existing quizzes to avoid duplicates
  DELETE FROM public.lesson_quizzes WHERE lesson_id = v_lesson_id;


  -- Question 1
  INSERT INTO public.lesson_quizzes (lesson_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation, sort_order)
  VALUES (
    v_lesson_id, 
    'What is the offer in a lead capture funnel?', 
    '["What you sell to customers","What the visitor gets in exchange for their contact information","Your business card","A paid product"]'::jsonb,
    'What the visitor gets in exchange for their contact information',
    'The offer is what you give visitors in exchange for their contact information—like a free guide, checklist, or consultation.', 
    1
  )
  RETURNING id INTO v_quiz_id;


  -- Question 2
  INSERT INTO public.lesson_quizzes (lesson_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation, sort_order)
  VALUES (
    v_lesson_id, 
    'Why should the offer be connected to what you sell?', 
    '["It does not matter","It should naturally lead to your paid products or services","To confuse customers","To give away everything for free"]'::jsonb,
    'It should naturally lead to your paid products or services',
    'The offer should attract people who are likely to become customers. A relevant offer pre-qualifies leads for your paid offerings.', 
    2
  )
  RETURNING id INTO v_quiz_id;


  -- Question 3
  INSERT INTO public.lesson_quizzes (lesson_id, question, options, correct_answer, explanation, sort_order)
  VALUES (
    v_lesson_id, 
    'What should you do before building the funnel page?', 
    '["Start building immediately","Choose a compelling offer first","Hire a designer","Buy advertising"]'::jsonb,
    'Choose a compelling offer first',
    'Always start with the offer. A great page cannot save a weak offer. Know what will make someone say yes before you build anything.', 
    3
  )
  RETURNING id INTO v_quiz_id;

END $$;
